{
  "uid": "dtms-order-intake",
  "title": "DTMS — Order Intake",
  "tags": [
    "dtms",
    "orders",
    "intake"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "system",
        "label": "Source system",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": null,
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(dtms_order_intake_accepted_total, system)",
          "refId": "system"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(dtms_order_intake_accepted_total, system)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Orders that reached a handler and were **accepted into planning** vs **refused at the door** (meter `DTMS.OrderIntake`).\n\n- **path** — `source` = POST /api/v1/source/delivery-orders (OMS…), `submit` / `bulk_submit` = DTMS UI, `resend` = Edit & resend.\n- **reason** — `route_not_dispatchable` (no usable order template → 422), `station_unknown` / `station_inactive` / `station_offline` (AMR), `wms_location_unknown` / `wms_location_inactive` (Manual), `mode_disabled` (422), `duplicate_ref` (409), `invalid` (other 400).\n- **location** — the station / WMS code at fault, or `PICKUP → DROP` for a route. A route refusal counts once per failing route.\n\nNot counted: body-validation 400s rejected before a handler runs — see `iam.SystemRequestLog`. Note: OMS retries a refused order (seen: 3× in ~20 s), so one bad order can count several times."
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Refused in range",
      "description": "Orders refused at intake over the selected time range (all paths).",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 20
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(dtms_order_intake_rejected_total{system=~\"$system\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Accepted in range",
      "description": "Orders accepted into planning over the selected time range.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(dtms_order_intake_accepted_total{system=~\"$system\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "id": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Refusal rate",
      "description": "Refused / (accepted + refused). Route refusals count per route, so this can read slightly high for multi-route orders.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.02
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(dtms_order_intake_rejected_total{system=~\"$system\"}[$__range])) / clamp_min(sum(increase(dtms_order_intake_rejected_total{system=~\"$system\"}[$__range])) + sum(increase(dtms_order_intake_accepted_total{system=~\"$system\"}[$__range])), 1)",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "id": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "No template (routes)",
      "description": "Route refusals — an order arrived on a pickup → drop pair with no usable order template (422).",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(dtms_order_intake_rejected_total{system=~\"$system\",reason=\"route_not_dispatchable\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "id": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Accepted vs refused per 5 min, by path",
      "description": "Bars per 5-minute bucket.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            },
            "drawStyle": "bars"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (path) (increase(dtms_order_intake_accepted_total{system=~\"$system\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "accepted · {{path}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (path) (increase(dtms_order_intake_rejected_total{system=~\"$system\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "refused · {{path}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "id": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Refused per 5 min, by reason",
      "description": "Which check is refusing orders.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            },
            "drawStyle": "bars"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (increase(dtms_order_intake_rejected_total{system=~\"$system\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "id": 7
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Most refused locations / routes in range",
      "description": "Fix these first: add or activate the order template (route_not_dispatchable), re-activate or replace the station / WMS location, or ask the source system to stop sending it.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(20, sum by (reason, location, path, system) (increase(dtms_order_intake_rejected_total{system=~\"$system\",location!=\"\"}[$__range])) > 0)",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "location": 0,
              "reason": 1,
              "path": 2,
              "system": 3,
              "Value": 4
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "location": "Location / route",
              "reason": "Reason",
              "path": "Path",
              "system": "System",
              "Value": "Refused"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Refused",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "id": 8
    }
  ]
}
